<title>NEW ZEALAND: Grocorp narrows year loss to NZ$625,000.</title>
<headline>Grocorp narrows year loss to NZ$625,000.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Sept 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				0.63 vs 2.05 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   loss 1.2 vs 3.9 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover				    51.5 vs 53.6</p>
<p>    Pretax loss				0.625 vs 2.07 loss</p>
<p>    Tax					    nil vs same</p>
<p>Note - Grocorp Pacific Ltd is a horticultural producer and exporter. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
